  "diagnosis_status": "source_supported",
  "diagnosis_summary": "Current public Rock source processes a loaded workflow during Workflow Entry block initialization. Workflow processing calls MarkComplete whenever no active activities remain, and MarkComplete unconditionally rewrites every activity completion time and the workflow CompletedDateTime before adding another completion log entry. This supports the reported timestamp mutation on the reviewed source revision; exact release-package boundaries remain unverified.",
  "workaround_summaries": [
    "When an existing completion timestamp is an audit or reporting datum, do not open that completed workflow through Workflow Entry. Use a read-only report or detail surface that does not process the workflow, and verify the chosen surface in staging."
